---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Klyna"
  description="Klyna is an indie studio building modern, open-source tools for makers, creators, and growth-minded folks."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-24">
    <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[color:var(--color-accent)] mb-3">
      About
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">
      A small studio with a long bench.
    </h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-[color:var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed text-lg">
      <p>
        Klyna started with a simple frustration: the SEO and growth tooling market is full
        of hype, dark patterns, and tools that quietly stop working when search algorithms
        shift. Most of them charge enterprise prices for dashboards that don't act on what
        they show you.
      </p>

      <p>
        We're building the opposite — a small family of focused, honest tools that any indie
        maker, creator, or store owner can install in one click. Every tool shares the same
        engine, so a fix to the core lifts the whole lineup. Every tool runs on your own
        server, in your own browser, or on infrastructure you control. Your data never
        leaves you, and we never charge for the infrastructure itself.
      </p>

      <p>
        The first three products ship in this order: a free browser extension that audits
        any page in one click, a WordPress plugin that automates the SEO work that actually
        moves rankings, and a Shopify app that grows organic traffic for stores. After that,
        the bench gets wider — analytics, content tools, link-in-bio, and more.
      </p>

      <p>
        Klyna is independent and self-funded. No venture pressure, no growth-at-all-costs,
        no AI-generated upsells. Just tools that earn the right to keep running.
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="my-12 border-[color:var(--color-border)]" />

    <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-text-dim)]">
      Want to chat? Find us on
      <a href="https://github.com/klynahq" class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">GitHub</a>
      or
      <a href="https://x.com/klynahq" class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">X</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
